            <ArticleTitle>Performance of targeted cell-free DNA (cfDNA) analysis with microarray quantitation for assessment of fetal sex and sex chromosome aneuploidy risk.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/uog.18968</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The accuracy of targeted cell-free DNA (cfDNA) testing with DANSR™ and FORTE™ for trisomies 21, 18 and 13 has been well demonstrated and is consistent across next generation sequencing and microarray quantitation methods.1.</AbstractText>
